      "mergeID": "639a8eddf24b5e5d5a5495b1",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Some worlds might want to use different default settings depending on the instance type (public, friends+, ect...). \nFor example, a public world could default to having a video player locked so trolls can't come in and put on a random loud video, but in friends+ or private instances the video player could be unlocked by default, so people wouldn't have to ask the instance master to unlock it if they want to show a video to their friends.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Add the ability to get the instance type via udon",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5e1cc02ff3dfc95397e0aadb",
      "private": false,
